Here’s what was added to `compose/ui` Diagram Storybook.

### New stories (`compose/Diagram`)

1. **`Design`** — `ComposeDiagram` with **`diffEnabled: false`**, no `designDiff`, **`selectionEnabled: false`** so you only see the flattened design.
2. **`Diff`** — same kit/design as elsewhere, with **`designDiff: previewDiff`**, **`diffEnabled: true`**, **`selectionEnabled: false`** so the story is about diff visualization only.
3. **`PieceSelection`** — uses the **`PieceSelection`** wrapper (`DiagramPieceSelection` import) so **only pieces** are selectable; default selection is `modifiedPiece`.
4. **`ConnectionSelection`** — uses the **`ConnectionSelection`** wrapper (`DiagramConnectionSelection` import) so **only connections** are selectable; default selection is `modifiedConnection`.

Shared layout is centralized in **`diagramFrame`**, and the old **`PiecesOnlySelection`** / **`ConnectionsOnlySelection`** stories were removed in favor of these wrappers so the stories match the real constrained APIs.

```99:148:/workspaces/semio/compose/ui/.storybook/stories/Diagram.stories.tsx
// #region 🔖DesignDiffSelectionVariants

/** Renders the flat design only: no diff overlay, selection off. */
export const Design: Story = {
  args: {
    kit: metabolismKit,
    designGuid: nakaginCapsuleTowerDesignGuid,
    diffEnabled: false,
    selectionEnabled: false,
    title: "Design",
  },
  render: (args) => diagramFrame(<Diagram {...args} />),
};

/** Shows added/removed/modified pieces and connections from `previewDiff`. */
export const Diff: Story = {
  args: {
    kit: metabolismKit,
    designGuid: nakaginCapsuleTowerDesignGuid,
    designDiff: previewDiff,
    diffEnabled: true,
    selectionEnabled: false,
    title: "Diff",
  },
  render: (args) => diagramFrame(<Diagram {...args} />),
};

/** Constrained `PieceSelection` wrapper: only pieces are selectable. */
export const PieceSelection: PieceSelectionStory = {
  // ...
};

/** Constrained `ConnectionSelection` wrapper: only connections are selectable. */
export const ConnectionSelection: ConnectionSelectionStory = {
  // ...
};
```

